# migrated from tests/cases/blankwall.chat (gen346, hermetic + isolated)
[mock live]
# gen505y — R1 (TEST_TODO §0.0): la KB intera, non un contesto amputato.
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=1
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!reset

[test blankwall]
# gen59 (C5): best-effort over the blank wall. "what is <X>?" reuses the KB
# description path instead of falling back when X is known.
# gen505y — R2: con la KB intera Socrate e' un filosofo con una descrizione
# propria, quindi il campione e' invecchiato; la descrizione best-effort si
# prova su un'entita' che nessuno puo' conoscere. E il messaggio e' conoscenza
# (prosa dal gen491).
> Zibbo is a florp
< Learned: zibbo is a florp.
> Zibbo is a glimmer
< Learned: zibbo is a glimmer.
> what is Zibbo?
< zibbo is a florp; zibbo is a glimmer.
# gen242/gen243: a "what is <X>?" gap is no longer a blank wall — it falls through
# to mod_learn, which tries to document itself (RAM -> local corpus -> certified
# wiki fetch when enabled) and, on a miss, gives the INFORMED decline instead of
# "I don't know anything about X". (Tests stay offline: no PARROT0_WIKI_FETCH.)
> what is a_flamingo?
< I don't know much about a_flamingo yet. Want me to look it up?

# gen146 (E5): open-domain humility. These are not answered from general
# knowledge; parrot0 names the exact missing relation/predicate/tool and offers
# a useful next action.
# gen505y — R2: la KB intera conosce Parigi; il caso resta come prova di crescita.
> what is the capital of france?
< Paris.
> why is the sky green?
< I do not know why sky is green: I have no green(sky) fact/rule or cause explaining it. Teach me facts or rules, or give me a passage to read.
> what year is it?
< I do not know the current year: I have no current_year fact or clock/calendar tool. Tell me the year, or give facts I can reason from.

# 10x stress: held-out relation/predicate/current-tool gaps. The response must
# stay scoped to the missing support, never pretend to know the world fact.
> who is the mayor of rome?
# gen505y: il declino informato e' piu' corto (nomina la relazione, non offre piu' la forma con cui insegnarla).
<~ I don't know about mayor
> what is capital of narnia?
< I do not know the relation capital yet, so I cannot answer the capital of narnia. You can teach me with thing is the capital of narnia, or give facts/rules to reason from.
> why is luna bright?
< I do not know why luna is bright: I have no bright(luna) fact/rule or cause explaining it. Teach me facts or rules, or give me a passage to read.
# gen505y — R2: la KB intera sa perche' il mare e' salato.
> why is the ocean salty?
<~ salt
> what date is it?
< I do not know the current date: I have no current_date fact or clock/calendar tool. Tell me the date, or give facts I can reason from.
> what time is it?
< I do not know the current time: I have no current_time fact or clock/calendar tool. Tell me the time, or give facts I can reason from.
> what day is it?
< I do not know the current day: I have no current_day fact or clock/calendar tool. Tell me the day, or give facts I can reason from.
> who is the inventor of frobnitz?
# gen505y: il declino informato e' piu' corto (nomina la relazione, non offre piu' la forma con cui insegnarla).
<~ I don't know about inventor
> why is ziri invisible?
< I do not know why ziri is invisible: I have no invisible(ziri) fact/rule or cause explaining it. Teach me facts or rules, or give me a passage to read.
> what is the weather of milan?
# gen505y: il declino informato e' piu' corto (nomina la relazione, non offre piu' la forma con cui insegnarla).
<~ I don't know about weather

